  exerciseNumber: 15
  exerciseName: PistolNotFollowingPlayer
  exerciseTitle: Pistol not following Player
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459474
  exerciseText: Pistol is not following the Player
  hintText: Why should it follow the Player? What code is telling it to do that?
  solutionText: Pistol script is not setting the parent so it has no parent which
    means it's not following anything. The parent should be set as the Player to
    follow it.
